# Claude agent harness — committed bits (CLAUDE.md, settings.json,
# hooks/, skills/, agents/) are shareable; everything else under
# .claude/ is local-only runtime state (settings.local.json,
# scheduled_tasks.lock, worktrees/, etc.) and stays ignored.
.claude/*
!.claude/settings.json
!.claude/hooks/
!.claude/skills/
!.claude/agents/
.claude/.stop-autoloop-state
